hts", "Speeding up token generation"], "correct_index": 0, "difficulty": "hard"}, {"question": "What is a key difference between extractive and generative summarization?", "options": ["Extractive selects existing sentences from the source; generative creates new sentences", "They produce identical results", "Extractive requires no source text", "Generative summarization cannot use LLMs"], "correct_index": 0, "difficulty": "hard"}, {"question": "Why might a team choose a smaller, fine-tuned model over a large general-purpose model for a narrow task?", "options": ["Lower cost and latency while still meeting quality needs for that specific task", "It will always be more accurate at every task", "Fine-tuned models require no data", "Smaller models cannot be deployed in production"], "correct_index": 0, "difficulty": "hard"}, {"question": "What does ''guardrails'' typically refer to in an AI application?", "options": ["Constraints and checks that keep model outputs safe, on-topic, and within policy", "A UI component for scrolling", "A database backup mechanism", "A type of prompt template only"], "correct_index": 0, "difficulty": "hard"}]'::jsonb, 70),
